==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|kroo͞|a=RP}}, {{IPA|en|/kɹuː/|[kɹuʊ̯]}}
* {{IPA|en|/kɹu/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-crew.ogg|a=GA}}
